  <title>2.14.2: Self Check</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00629</md:content-id>
    <md:title>2.14.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>30dd9e02-3c0a-470b-b001-1c27f2676cd3</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><para>A singer sold two types of tickets to a performance, seated tickets and standing-room tickets.</para>
<list>
  <item>Seated tickets cost $25.</item>
  <item>Standing-room tickets cost $15.</item>
  <item>More than 60 tickets were sold.</item>
  <item>More than $1,200 was made from selling tickets.</item>
</list>
<para>Which of the following ticket combinations is possible given the situation described here?</para></note>
</content>
</document>
